# Case of the Stashed Skeleton. As it enters it makes a 2/1 black Skeleton token and suspects it (CR 701.60a): the token is
# suspected, and so has menace and "This creature can't block" (CR 701.60c). At the beginning of Bot1's turn-1 end step it
# controls a suspected Skeleton, so "To solve - You control no suspected Skeletons" does not trigger. Bot2 bolts the Skeleton
# on turn 2; at the turn-3 end step there is none, so the Case becomes solved (CR 719.3a). Before that, on turn 3, its
# "Solved" ability is not offered though {1}{B} is there to pay (CR 702.169d); once solved it is still not offered on Bot2's
# turn (activate only as a sorcery), and on turn 5 Bot1 sacrifices the Case and searches its library for Black Lotus.

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Mox Jet
Case of the Stashed Skeleton
Swamp x4
Swamp
Swamp
Black Lotus
Swamp x8

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Lightning Bolt
Island x18

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Case of the Stashed Skeleton.Cast
[T1 Bot1.End]
? Stack.Count = 0
? Bot1.Battlefield.Skeleton Token.Suspected = true
? Bot1.Battlefield.Skeleton Token.Keywords = CantBlock; Menace
? Bot1.Battlefield.Skeleton Token.Token = true
? Bot1.Battlefield.Skeleton Token.Power = 2
? Bot1.Battlefield.Skeleton Token.Toughness = 1
? Bot1.Battlefield.Skeleton Token.Colors = Black
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Skeleton Token)
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
! Bot1.Battlefield.Case of the Stashed Skeleton.Activate
[T3 Bot1.End]
? Stack.Count = 1
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Case of the Stashed Skeleton.Solved = true
Bot2.Pass
! Bot1.Battlefield.Case of the Stashed Skeleton.Activate
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Case of the Stashed Skeleton.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp#1.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Search(Black Lotus)

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield = Mox Jet; Swamp
Bot1.Graveyard = Case of the Stashed Skeleton
Bot1.Hand = Black Lotus; Swamp; Swamp; Swamp; Swamp; Swamp; Swamp
Bot1.Library.Count = 8
